  <div class="section-label">THE STARTING POINT</div><div>
    <h2>We don’t all build AI.<br />We all live <em>with it.</em></h2><div
      class="intro-columns"
    >
      <p>
        A camera becomes searchable. An agent gains authority. A model finds a
        vulnerability or a mathematical proof. Each changes what people can do,
        who benefits, and who must answer when something goes wrong.
      </p><p>
        Common Obligations asks what AI builders owe the people affected by
        their systems. Explore six scenarios, examine the tradeoffs, and trace
        the checks that could make a difference.
      </p>
